# Integration-test fixtures: cached YugabyteDB installs + per-test data dirs.
# Managed by api_server/testlib/ybdb (downloads tarball on first run).
#
# Unanchored, so it matches any directory named tests anywhere under meko/ -- which
# is how the Helm chart's helm-unittest suites came to be untracked when the chart
# was imported from meko-devops. Checked-in suites need an explicit negation.
tests/
!deploy/helm/meko/tests/

